  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/calypsonet/keyple-demo-ticketing/zipball/26.11.20",
  "body": "### Added\r\n- Validation application: Famoco FX925 terminal (\"Famoco FX925 / PCL + SE COM\"), its contactless reader (Ingenico Open1500 module) being accessed with the PCL plugin of Famoco, proprietary and available on request from Famoco (grayed out without it), and its SAM with the Famoco plugin; storage cards not supported on this terminal.\r\n### Changed\r\n- Validation and Inspection applications: terminal selection buttons showing the tested model, then, smaller, the configuration of the readers or the library of the manufacturer required (\"Famoco FX205 / NFC + SE COM\", \"Famoco FX207 / NFC + OMAPI\", \"Famoco FX925 / PCL + SE COM\", \"Bluebird EF5x1 / Bluebird SDK\", \"Arrive Axio 4 / Arrive SDK\"), instead of the reader configuration only; the terminals announced by the plugins are listed in the READMEs.\r\n- Validation application: full screen (status and navigation bars hidden, shown by a swipe from the screen edge), the screen staying on.\r\n### Fixed\r\n- Validation application: card detection restarted after an unexpected error of the reader (for example, a read timeout of the Open1500 module), which no longer detected the cards; the restart is delayed (from 1 to 30 s, doubled at each new error).\r\n### Upgraded\r\n- `keyple-plugin-cna-famoco-se-communication-java-lib`: `2.0.2` -> `2.1.0` (validation and inspection)."
